fbe704" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360264 1145 "The (population) covariance of the data sets $x={{x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}}$ and $y={{y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n}}$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\text{Cov}(x,y)=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}),\n$$\n\nwhere $\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}$ and $\\overset{―}{y}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{y}_{i}$ are the means of the data sets.\n\nTherefore, the covariance of our data sets is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}(x,y) & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(1-3)(2-3)+(2-3)(1-3)+(2-3)(3-3)+(7-3)(6-3)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(-2)(-1)+(-1)(-2)+(-1)(0)+(4)(3)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[2+2+0+12] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 16 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360266 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360267 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360268 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360269 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360270 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1041 "selection" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360268 13194139535670 true] [17592186360265 1110 #uuid "a9b32f33-1de9-5d68-bec4-966608b18422" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360266 1034 "2.5" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360266 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535670 true] [17592186360266 1111 #uuid "9f7bf132-19c3-5728-baf1-0206f165253f" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360267 1034 "3" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360267 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535670 true] [17592186360267 1111 #uuid "926e08ff-1e28-5eb1-a9fc-9ae46a37b025" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360268 1034 "4" 13194139535670 true] [17592186360268 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535670 true] [17592186360268 1111 #uuid "ea